               skos:definition "A connector with a Type 1 connection pattern" .


###  http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/chio/CHIO_00000031
:CHIO_00000031 rdf:type owl:Class ;
               owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( :CHIO_00000012
                                                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
